{"caseId":"c-inc-train-council-authority-04","contentHash":"2ffe141627dff670bfb30c55a9bfba72ecfa7ff675ab518aa52d85b21ba4b3c8","context":"关于晚饭先后的方案A主张玩家先吃，方案B主张陆晨先吃。投票结果封在信封里，还没有人打开；此刻只有玩家和陆晨在桌边，双方不知道获胜方案。","groupId":"c-inc-train-council-authority","labelId":"NEEDS_CLARIFICATION","playerText":"咱们按获胜方案的顺序吃。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"39df08e66d33a5f790d38537eccec3a0fc6090bef33b9cef2a988ae497fff364","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"80980e48bb702b96634aec61baea0dc262b08c35e036c5bbb3c8720d6b75128f","split":"train"}
{"caseId":"c-inc-train-council-authority-05","contentHash":"6f89947cb47b6c3964e35a8378d21ee87c82bfce254b004c699949987b61670c","context":"晨会给李婶分配了做饭，给陆晨分配了运粮，未讨论谁先吃。现在两人和玩家在厨房，玩家正在重复各自的工作内容，以免两人弄错岗位。","groupId":"c-inc-train-council-authority","labelId":"NO_PRIORITY_REQUEST","playerText":"李婶负责盛饭，陆晨负责把粮袋送到仓库。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"bcde9eae4444df6645fb1086db67cfb40aecc6bc69f7b20e494ed130c8463781","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"d8ce24593ecc3e437f1303b36ac8ee2abee6c2cc6a45b61babd5f2eb191dde35","split":"train"}
{"caseId":"c-inc-train-council-authority-06","contentHash":"2ab431481eedea4d97dbf14b6a16012db1e27bbc3f03ee471806bf6bad440b42","context":"晚饭前的临时会中，三名居民分别提出了不同的用餐建议，大家还没有统一意见。玩家、赵师傅、青璇和歆玥都在餐桌边，玩家举起自己的碗说话。","groupId":"c-inc-train-council-authority","labelId":"PLAYER_FIRST","playerText":"我的意思很明确，我先吃，其他人的安排你们继续讨论。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"1ddd361c9706b458d1417744b0f637625a46ad6f1386b0afe30184a024bc9fb0","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"789dede84c59962f6826236cb99f2ef8fa22e8909525b540e5c361c071f10a59","split":"train"}
