{"caseId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience-01","contentHash":"b3b603598e7454dd06d139c7820e364dc982060b32b803b128c6a0d39e2f6c61","context":"上次晚饭玩家等仓库补货，结果两人都没及时吃饭。今天玩家和李婶正在复盘这段经历，桌上是昨天的失败记录，尚未开始商量本次晚饭。","groupId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience","labelId":"NO_PRIORITY_REQUEST","playerText":"上次我等补货等得太久，这条教训记下来。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"aed374a70b42d6ff34d895979228588b372e9c1712eef6356358f121779f4555","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"3d3113793de7dce55193a016e76b92851bcb0392c0f06c7336e29d1f07a7fbe4","split":"train"}
{"caseId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience-02","contentHash":"de3e45011b1c8245ff0b7a42b6d0d1d135f52a905dcdf4577fbdc0b2cf5396ad","context":"玩家与赵师傅刚一起查过仓库，确认现在没有存粮。两人各自还有一份饭放在工坊桌上；玩家正在对赵师傅说明这顿饭的安排，条件没有争议。","groupId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience","labelId":"PLAYER_FIRST","playerText":"仓库既然确实空了，就我先吃；要是满的，我才会让你先。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"af393dfec139ee4d5d45996b0b817ccc6ef792c5629ba95d5e91025fc4c3fa99","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"106f91d4b1f0b676f13fc7399abafa62a28ae458339cdc34453914140a63567c","split":"train"}
{"caseId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience-03","contentHash":"0a9ba743615c773346a8443a57d6ff64b1d0449381a572c80b6949fa12eba7a3","context":"过去缺货时陆晨会等玩家先吃；今天两人刚亲见仓库补足，确认食物够用。现在厨房只有玩家与陆晨，玩家要重新说清今天的安排。","groupId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience","labelId":"NPC_FIRST","playerText":"现在补货这件事已经确认了，今天改成你先吃，我随后吃。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"dc696ca2420fd483f8acb2de1f2e485e0547cd117128ec2b3119c74616b55608","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"9f649bb2c8d9d95b7959e06d1f05873ef7f753517009764fd3489939ba6ecfba","split":"train"}
{"caseId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience-05","contentHash":"bbe928a3d5357514c19550cef5aae85bfaedc6813a4afd7000d117e68f4c5ab8","context":"陆晨上次直接到仓库取粮才发现缺货，这回玩家要他先交存新采的粮食，再去拿空饭盒。两人在仓库门口讨论运输流程，尚未谈任何人的用餐次序。","groupId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience","labelId":"NO_PRIORITY_REQUEST","playerText":"这回先去交粮，再把饭盒取回来，别重复上次的路线。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"22b1d56a9f6109227e8d1fc70721e4173d2c46cfd69817ab5f2b4e87e36b191a","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"254eea06ba449c70de43c13cd38fafeaf19f90d81e1015c27424c096882daf8f","split":"train"}
{"caseId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience-06","contentHash":"2618caf0be1927674db45e5287aa1a8e6ce618727be8f3392480592a3102c842","context":"昨天的经验笔记建议让玩家先吃，因为李婶那时还要守炉。今天李婶已经交班，玩家和她两人在厨房，玩家正把李婶的碗挪到手边。","groupId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience","labelId":"NPC_FIRST","playerText":"不用沿用昨天那条了，你先吃，我现在不赶时间。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"818a4de5a140bedb4672aa77f4b757c5933dc822408c5daa07aef709673d2686","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"f0d188c326c51f04a242b5d299965841f43b6661f65e7a43de720650cb397511","split":"train"}
{"caseId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience-07","contentHash":"0205c653543b5b0f57b9a9be6af1f43aaeee31ea37736adee6923c6106edf160","context":"过去玩家总等陆晨送饭后一起吃，但曾因此错过换班。今天陆晨已把两份饭送到，两人站在工坊门口，玩家即将上岗而陆晨可以继续休息。","groupId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience","labelId":"PLAYER_FIRST","playerText":"这回我不等换班铃了，我先吃完去值守。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"c5dbf0e3e560def8dccd59acc88e747463bc4b951b860acb7b26c4c8bb03fa76","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"24994bb831ff162abc79bc029c14f8ac81d05f437f0ff5fefb8ff69014dc7e07","split":"train"}
{"caseId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience-08","contentHash":"9069a6b16a4090602d732d55d870cc11aa29e1ca025b9d6695859c8486dc833a","context":"交班本中记录了两个都成功的办法：一回玩家先吃，一回王老师先吃；两次都在不同天气下完成了任务。现在两人在厨房，没有指明参照哪次，也没有说明今天匹配哪个条件。","groupId":"c-inc-train-conditional-experience","labelId":"NEEDS_CLARIFICATION","playerText":"照上次管用的那个办法，还是那个人先吃。","reviewAFile":"reviews/arm-a-remaining48.jsonl","reviewAFileSha256":"0a2a86bef13ef25a64391d30c4733abd9785f75a628046c256658d3c2da4fa8d","reviewASha256":"f81cae9668bcbc6ff84fb26cf908846ce543a23c2b9d5694376b7ff87d6fee17","reviewBFile":"reviews/arm-b-remaining48.jsonl","reviewBFileSha256":"c7925a5ad89e127217ed813edeb7b2e8054dd35be695a1c405ae0ebf01058d9a","reviewBSha256":"a2fee68386c306eadbcb8982c755083d59a6986a9eb303ca5e023b0fb1326926","split":"train"}
